{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"CI correlation (GitHub Actions error sweep, 2026-08-29): the scheduled **Terraform Drift** workflow (`.github/workflows/terraform-drift.yml`) has been red since 2026-08-25 (green through 2026-08-24), and its failure is exactly this bug's plan.\n\nRun https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/33238776345 (sha `5fb693345b0c`), step `terraform plan -input=false -lock=false -detailed-exitcode` exits **2** (drift detected):\n```\n# aws_cloudwatch_metric_alarm.mcp_mem_abort   will be created\n# aws_cloudwatch_metric_alarm.mcp_retire_cap  will be created\n# aws_instance.gerrit                          will be updated in-place\n# aws_ssm_parameter.rebar_secrets[\"/rebar/prod/mcp-client-pat-claude\"]    will be created\n# aws_ssm_parameter.rebar_secrets[\"/rebar/prod/mcp-client-pat-codex\"]     will be created\n# aws_ssm_parameter.rebar_secrets[\"/rebar/prod/mcp-client-pat-copilot\"]   will be created\n# aws_ssm_parameter.rebar_secrets[\"/rebar/prod/mcp-tickets-pat\"]          will be created\nPlan: 6 to add, 1 to change, 0 to destroy.\n```\nThis matches the ticket precisely: the three `mcp-client-pat-*` SSM parameters planned as `create` (the adopt-via-import defect described here), the clean `mcp-tickets-pat` create, the `mcp_mem_abort`/`mcp_retire_cap` alarms, and the in-place `aws_instance.gerrit` update (the Gerrit stop/start the ticket's operator-awareness note flags). The daily Terraform Drift schedule will stay red until this is resolved (import blocks added and an apply completed). No new ticket filed — recording the CI manifestation here."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788023949113060670,"uuid":"1234d10d-c2ae-4fd4-babc-1b979e9f5158"}